# Durable Threads

Public Codex plugin. Canonical skill: `plugins/durable-threads/skills/durable-threads/`.

Do not add a second skill install surface.

## Own this work

Plugin, marketplace, public docs, Python helper, and public self-host TypeScript.

Hosted SaaS product work belongs in sibling `durable-platform`.

## Checks

```text
python3 -m pytest
ruff check .
python3 -m compileall -q src scripts
python3 scripts/validate_repo.py
npm test
```

## Safety

Use live model discovery. Do not invent a model identifier. Do not add real thread IDs, transcripts, or secrets to committed files. Do not merge, push, or deploy without explicit user intent.

Lead docs with the zero-config Codex path.
